               <section class="support" style="margin-top: -4.5rem; padding: 0; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
                  
                  <div class="snapon_header">
                     
                     <h1>What Will <span>You</span> Build?</h1>
                     
                     <p>Every day, students, instructors and graduates of Lawson State are building the future
                        - the future of America and their own futures.These stories often go untold, running
                        in the background of our lives, until now. Snap-on is teaming up with Lawson State
                        to highlight the stories of Makers and Fixers. The people that solve problems with
                        their hands - and heads - to keep society running. These are stories of Lawson's people
                        doing real work for the real world.</p>
                     
                     <p>Snap-on is teaming up with Lawson State to highlight the stories of <a href="https://www.snapon.com/EN/Makers-and-Fixers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Makers and Fixers</a> - people who solve problems with their hands <em>and</em> their heads to keep society running.These are the stories of Lawson's people doing
                        real work for the real world.</p>
                     
                     <p>Makers and Fixers are building the future. And futures get built at <strong style="color: #ffc424;">Lawson State.</strong>Lawson State.</p>
                     </div>
                  
                  <div class="snapon">
                     
                     <div class="snapon_video">
                        
                        <figure><iframe style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;" title="Lawson anthem v2" src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1058690019?h=ff50502b3b&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479" frameborder="0" loading="lazy">
                              </iframe></figure>
                        <script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script>
                        </div>
                     
